WEBVTT

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:43.250
A million words aren't enough
to describe this beauty.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:46.790
I think that every time I see his dancing.

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:56.750
I understand why the boss would be so insistent.

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:58.620
The pride of Royal...

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:13.540
We've been looking for you.

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:16.040
We're going back together, Leonardo.

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:18.950
I-I am a ninja, indeed.

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:20.450
If you throw a tantrum,

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:23.660
then you'll cause trouble for
the people you're staying with.

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:26.450
The Aragaki family, was it?

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.370
"I've set out on a journey
for training, indeed
Leo"

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:50.870
We've brought him.

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:55.540
When I ran away from home,

00:01:55.540 --> 00:02:00.910
my mother would hang me up
on a tree as punishment--

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:02.750
Upside down.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:05.250
That was really painful.

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:09.660
Did you have fun on your trip?

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:14.870
Now, change your clothes immediately

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:17.370
and go there.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:20.370
I... can't go back yet...

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:25.790
The way I am now...

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:27.700
...I can't dance...

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:34.620
Ninja Technique: Dogeza!

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:37.750
Please, let me go back to Japan!

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:42.660
In order for me to dance again,
I have to go back there!

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:46.080
So, please! Let me go!

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:57.040
This is the last time.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.500
But only until winter.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:04.120
If you break your promise again,

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:07.500
then it won't be enough
just to hang you from a tree.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:17.450
Is something wrong?

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:19.500
It came out pretty good, right?

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:22.580
Come on, wanna play sharp
and pointy rock-paper-scissors?

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:25.290
Then, let's start, indeed!

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:27.580
We'll start from the first scene, okay?

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:29.160
Let's go to my room!

00:03:54.200 --> 00:04:02.950
"The Gymnastics Samurai"

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:07.950
"Training Camp Samurai"

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:07.950
This is where we'll be having
the training camp with China.

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:10.040
It hasn't changed at all...

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:11.160
Oh?

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:16.330
This takes me back.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:19.120
You must be from the Japan team!

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:20.870
We've been waiting for you!

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:23.790
I'm Li from the General
Administration of Sport of China.

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.620
Thank you for coming to meet us.

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:28.700
I'm Nakanomori from the
Japan Gymnastics Association.

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:33.330
I've been looking forward
to this joint training!

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:35.290
We arrived earlier,

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:38.950
so our gymnasts are already
in the practice area.

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:46.870
Oh, I remember this!

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:51.040
Look at that.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:52.370
That's...

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:02.750
A Maltese cross...

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:05.870
It's what I did at the NHK Cup.

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:08.370
He has all those weights on, too.

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:10.410
This is what it means to be the best, huh?

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:13.330
The one at the top of them is <i>him</i>.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:18.120
The king of last year's world
championship, Liu Longxiang.

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:25.410
Oh, look at this!
I can't believe it's still here!

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:27.000
That's...

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:36.330
For this joint training between China and Japan,

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:40.660
we are crossing borders to share our
gymnastics techniques with each other.

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:44.660
This is not just a chance for each team to grow,

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:47.950
but it also promotes cultural
exchange between our countries--

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:53.120
I came here...

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:55.290
...in order to beat you.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:00.330
Have a match with me.

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:02.000
This is...

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:05.870
I see! This is what's called
the "Japanese spirit"!

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:08.080
What wonderful passion.

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:12.370
If we do not accept, we will lose face! Liu!

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:23.330
That guy...

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:25.870
He's self-centered and selfish...

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:27.160
But...!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:37.790
Oh! He goes right into a Kolman!

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:45.700
Consecutive Tkatchevs?!

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:48.950
He's increased the difficulty since the NHK Cup?

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:51.120
What a jerk...

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:07.000
We coaches have given him this score.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.040
9.675...

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:12.200
With such a high score, maybe...

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:14.500
It's your turn now, Liu!

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:34.790
A full twisting Tkatchev--a Liukin?!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.330
Now a Def?

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:49.750
Pogorelov?!

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:55.080
He's doing the hardest of the Tkatchev,
Gienger, and Jäger moves in succession?

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:05.410
He finished it with a difficult
Super E level skill…

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:07.750
...the Faldan!

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.200
His score is...

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:12.950
...9.825!

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:14.370
This...

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:16.700
...is the power of the world championship king...

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.290
Um...

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.620
Can I try something, too?

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.200
Of course!

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.830
We welcome anyone with passion!

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:35.830
What is he planning?

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:39.120
Does he think he can beat that score?

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.750
Oh?

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.450
The ban is lifted.

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:50.700
Huh?

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:52.580
You've done a good job so far.

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:56.040
You should be able to do it
without any problem now.

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:57.620
The ban is lifted.

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.000
A triple... The Aragaki?

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:08.540
A perfect Aragaki...

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:14.790
Huh?

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:17.910
Yes! Yes! Yes! All right!

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:20.410
--I did it! Whoo!

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:22.910
--He just... jumped off...?
--I did it! Yes!

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:25.160
--After doing just one move...
--I did it! I did it!

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:28.330
--Wait, don't tell me... just because
he did the Aragaki successfully...?
--Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:31.290
--He really is unpredictable.
--Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:32.660
All right!

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.410
We just started,

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:48.250
and already we were treated
to such a wonderful match!

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:51.660
It really is a fitting start
to this training camp!

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:54.250
Gentlemen, for the next few days,

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:57.200
I hope you will give it your all
and work hard at this training camp!

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:14.660
"Last day of training camp"

00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:21.120
There are so many people!

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:23.750
That's because it's open practice day,

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:26.160
so a lot of press is here.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:29.830
But that's also why I could get special
permission for you guys to come watch.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:32.620
Joe is practicing here, right?

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.200
Dad!

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:36.540
Hm?

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:37.870
Rei!

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:41.580
How's it going?

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:45.080
Oh, sorry to make you
go through all this trouble...

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:47.910
It's fine. I'm the one who invited them.

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:50.660
It was Rei's birthday yesterday, right?

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:54.370
It's her birthday present.

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:56.660
Rei, happy birthday.

00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:59.080
You already told me on the phone yesterday.

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:04.000
Daughter...?

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:14.410
Tecchan...!

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:18.200
I'm Leo! Leo!

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:19.160
The ninja, Leo!

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:20.160
Do you remember me?

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:22.500
I'm the Leo who was with Joe the other day!

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:25.410
Hey, why are you running by yourself?

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:27.370
You're not practicing with everyone else?

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:29.950
Why aren't you talking?

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:31.540
Oh, is that part of your practice?

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:34.830
But what does that have to do with gymnastics?

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:38.290
You're so fast, Tecchan!

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:41.830
But I won't lose, either!
Because I'm a ninja, indeed!

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:43.160
Damn it...

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:55.450
This was fun, Tecchan!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:01.700
Where are we...?

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:06.540
Is something happening outside?

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:09.700
No, it's just Minamino seems
to be out pretty late.

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:13.160
Oh, yeah, he was practicing
on his own the whole time, huh?

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:18.250
I guess what happened on
the first day was hard on him.

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:23.160
The more competitive someone is,

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:27.160
the more likely they are
to break with one failure.

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:29.330
It's not that unusual.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:35.330
This way?

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:47.540
Could it be... that you have
no sense of direction?

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:49.120
It's fine, indeed!

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:52.580
Even if you have no sense of direction,
you're really good at gymnastics!

00:13:58.200 --> 00:13:59.450
Damn it...

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:06.250
Hey...

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:09.040
Why do you do gymnastics, Tecchan?

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:16.120
When Joe's doing gymnastics,
he looks like he's having fun, indeed!

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:18.540
--You should also--
--Don't lump me with him.

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:24.200
He's... been done for a while now.

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:27.830
It's unsightly for him
to still be trying so hard.

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:32.160
This is no place for someone who can't win.

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:51.410
Isn't it scary, Tecchan?
To live in a world like that...

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:58.540
If... If you someday realize that
you aren't good enough on your own...

00:14:58.540 --> 00:14:59.370
What will you do?

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:00.540
Shut up.

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:05.040
I will win.

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:12.120
Even if I lose now,

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:14.410
in the end, I will definitely win...

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:18.040
That's my gymnastics.

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:22.500
I finally found you.

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:25.410
As I thought, you were lost, huh?

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:27.500
Now, let's get back.

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:29.950
So that you don't lose next time.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.870
Today is the last day of the training camp!

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:46.450
It was only for a short time,
but I think it was a very fruitful camp.

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:49.120
We, China and Japan, are rivals.

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:51.580
But at the same time, we are friends.

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:55.290
Let us work together to bring
excitement to the gymnastics world!

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:58.540
It's not much, but to close this training camp,

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:00.870
we have prepared a dinner party.

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:03.540
Please enjoy your last night.

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:09.660
I'm going to get a drink. Do you want anything?

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:11.450
Oh, milk...

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:12.700
Got it.

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:28.080
U-Um... uh...

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:31.290
You're Tomoyo Mifune's daughter, aren't you?

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:33.330
Huh?

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:35.250
Oh, that's--

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:38.330
I'm a huge fan of hers!

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.660
I knew you were her daughter when I saw you!

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:42.500
I mean, you look just like her!

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:45.450
Y-You think so...?

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:49.410
I'm Kitty Zhang. Do you think
we can talk for a bit?

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:52.290
Hello, Kitty! Sure!

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:58.370
Honestly, I wasn't that
excited to come at first.

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:00.370
But I've changed my mind.

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:03.450
Japan is getting steadily better.

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:05.410
Thanks to you guys,
it's been a good training camp.

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:08.450
Same here. I've learned a lot.

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:11.870
But, what was <i>that</i>?

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:13.500
Doing that during the match...

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:16.790
What was he trying to do?

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:21.700
Oh... He's always been hard to understand...

00:17:25.080 --> 00:17:27.000
Wh-What's that?

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:36.410
A triple...

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:40.870
You don't have a monopoly on triples.

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.410
Jotaro Aragaki.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.330
Huh?

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:48.620
At the Olympics seven years ago,

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:54.830
I saw the "Japanese Samurai" who won
the silver medal with my own eyes.

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:56.120
Are you surprised?

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:59.620
Oh, uh... I've never heard you talk before...

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:03.540
I just don't like idle chatter.

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:08.910
This is perfect. There's
something I'd like to ask you.

00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:10.750
Why are you here?

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:13.250
Huh?

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:15.830
We agreed to this training camp

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:21.450
to see the abilities of up-and-coming
young Japanese gymnasts.

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:24.750
In reality, while Tetsuo Minamino
is still rough around the edges,

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:27.870
he is very talented.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:30.540
I'm sure he will be a top gymnast
on the world level someday,

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:34.870
pushing the other gymnasts here out of the way.

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:39.870
That was how I, myself, got to where I am today.

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:45.120
This is the top I've reached
after stepping over many.

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:48.660
That's why I know my own limits.

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:50.750
I only have a few years left of my peak.

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:53.410
After that, I'll be overtaken by other gymnasts.

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:57.540
Everyone will lose someday.

00:18:57.540 --> 00:19:00.250
You can't go against your own limits.

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:02.870
But then, why are you here?

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:05.450
You're already past your peak as a gymnast.

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:08.410
Do you really think you can win after this?

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:12.250
Huh? I don't know...

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:17.540
I hurt my shoulder,

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:20.250
and for a long time,
I wasn't performing at my best.

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:23.080
Everyone around me was also really worried,

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:27.040
so I decided at one point to retire.

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:30.500
But, you know...

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:34.500
It was like, even then,
I was thinking the whole time...

00:19:36.450 --> 00:19:39.410
"I can still do it, though."

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:44.450
I was told that it was impossible,

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:49.250
and in my head, I understood... But...

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:53.790
My body still moved,
and I could still swing on the bar.

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:57.500
The Aragaki, too--I couldn't
do it for a long time,

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:00.790
but then I did it, and I was so happy...

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:06.080
Before I knew it, I was shouting, "I did it!"

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:11.580
Even if I'm told I can't do something,
I can't feel that way.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:16.790
I did the Aragaki.
So, I can do other things, too.

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:19.370
Someday, definitely.

00:20:19.370 --> 00:20:22.080
Even then, you will reach your limit.

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:25.160
That... might be true.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:31.250
But, even so, as long as my body will move,

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:33.450
I will do it.

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:36.000
Don't tell me you're going
to keep trying until you die?

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:40.120
Huh? Die? What?

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:43.700
Oh... but yeah, maybe...

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:45.830
Yeah, I will.

00:20:56.830 --> 00:20:59.870
I haven't laughed like this in a long time.

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:02.040
Well then, I'm going back to practicing.

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:03.290
What?!

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:08.000
Oh, right. Let me give you some advice.

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:12.330
You won't be able to compete
with just the Aragaki.

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:14.080
In that match the other day,

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:17.370
needless to say, you would
not have been able to beat me,

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:20.080
but you wouldn't have even been
able to beat Minamino's score.

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:24.910
Goodbye, Japanese Samurai.

00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:03.790
I can't win the way I am now.

00:23:03.790 --> 00:23:06.330
I have no choice but to do it--

00:23:06.330 --> 00:23:08.950
A quadruple.

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:11.200
Aragaki Mark II, huh?
